# SHA-256 of every source document redistributed in data-sources/.
#
# These PDFs are the authority for every rate and cap the site publishes.
# Recording their digests separates the two ways extracted numbers can
# change: a different source document, or a different pdftotext version
# parsing the same document. Without this, both look identical.
#
# Verify:  sha256sum -c SOURCES.sha256
# Regenerate after adding a source:
#   find data-before-filter data-after-filter -name '*.pdf' | sort | xargs sha256sum

